  "category" : "Students and Teachers",
  "createdAt" : 1706289939,
  "description" : "This dataset summarizes the educator evaluation summative performance ratings for educators who completed Massachusetts educator preparation programs and were employed in Massachusetts public schools since 2015. \n\nEducator evaluation performance is determined by matching program completers reported by preparation program providers in the Educator Licensure and Renewal (ELAR) system with educator evaluation data collected from districts in the Education Personnel Information Management System (EPIMS).\n\nIn instances where a cell is blank, the data is suppressed due to one of the following reasons: \n<ul><li>The number of staff evaluated was fewer than 6</li><li>All staff evaluated in the group received the same rating</li><li>All educators were evaluated and a single educator had a rating different from all other educators with the same rating in the group</li><li>If the \"Administrators\" or \"Teachers\" row is suppressed, all group rows are suppressed with the exception of \"All Educators\"</li></ul>This dataset contains the same data that is also published on our DESE Profiles site: \n<a href=\" https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/statereport/epppprogramcompleterperformance.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ed Prep Completer Performance</a>",
